    "text": "KTVZ\nwebsite\nSeneca\nSpecial Weather Statement issued July 2 at 2:16PM PDT by NWS Pendleton OR\nBy National Weather Service,\n7 hours agoAt 215 PM PDT, Doppler radar was tracking a strong thunderstorm near. Seneca, or 13 miles south of John Day, moving northeast at 25 mph. HAZARD…Wind gusts up to 50 mph and half inch hail. SOURCE…Radar indicated. IMPACT…Gusty winds could knock down tree limbs and blow around.",
